The '''Deformed Revenant''' is a [[Mob]] and {{MobCategory|Slayer Miniboss}} that may spawn during [[Revenant Horror]] {{SlayerTier|IV}} Quests. 

== Spawning ==
The '''Deformed Revenant''' has a chance to spawn when a Zombie-type mob is killed during Revenant Horror {{SlayerTier|IV}} quests. Its spawning is marked by explosion sounds and particles.

== Behavior ==
'''Deformed Revenants''' will seek out and attack the player who summoned it. They have a short player detection range and are slower than the weaker [[Revenant Champion]].

